<!-- ---------------- BONAFIDE CERTIFICATE ---------------- -->

<h1><span style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-font-kerni=
ng:
18.0pt'>Bonafide Certificate<o:p></o:p></span></h1>

<p>This is to certify that the thesis titled <b>&#8220;Real Estate Project
Management System&#8221;</b> is a bona fide record of the project work carr=
ied
out by <b>Maxamuud Abdiqaadir Maxamed</b> under my supervision, in partial
fulfilment of the requirements for the award of the Degree of Bachelor of
Science in Computer Science at East Africa University &#8211; Garowe, Facul=
ty
of Technology and Engineering.</p>

<p>The work presented in this thesis has not been submitted, in part or in =
full,
for the award of any other degree or diploma of this or any other instituti=
on.</p>

