<!-- ---------------- DECLARATION ---------------- -->

<h1><span style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-font-kerni=
ng:
18.0pt'>Declaration<o:p></o:p></span></h1>

<p>I, Maxamuud Abdiqaadir Maxamed, declare that this thesis, titled &#8220;=
Real
Estate Project Management System,&#8221; is my own original work and has not
been presented for the award of any degree or professional certificate in a=
ny
other university or institution of higher learning. Where other sources have
been consulted, they have been duly acknowledged in the text and listed in =
the
reference section.</p>

