<h1><span style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-font-kerni=
ng:
18.0pt'>Chapter Four: System Analysis and Design<o:p></o:p></span></h1>

<h2><span style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>4.1 Requireme=
nts
specification<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<h3><span style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>4.1.1 Functio=
nal
requirements<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p>The functional requirements of the system, summarised in Table 4.7, desc=
ribe
the specific tasks that the system must be able to perform for its different
categories of user. These requirements were derived directly from the probl=
ems
identified in Section 1.2 and were validated against the module-by-module
review carried out at the end of each development iteration, as described in
Section 3.5.</p>

<p class=3Dtblcap>Table 4.7: Summary of functional requirements</p>

