<h2><span style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>4.5 Database =
design<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<p>The database was implemented using Entity Framework Core's Code-First
approach, meaning that the schema shown in this section was generated from =
C#
entity classes and evolved through migrations, rather than being hand-writt=
en
in Structured Query Language. Tables 4.1 through 4.5 document the attribute=
s of
the five most central entities in the schema; the remaining entities, namely
Project, ProjectTask, PropertyImage, Document, Notification, and
ApplicationUser, are described narratively in Section 4.6 alongside the mod=
ule
that principally uses them.</p>

