pan
  style=3D'font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Regi=
ster
  customers, record sales and rentals, upload related documents<o:p></o:p><=
/span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style=3D'mso-yfti-irow:4'>
  <td valign=3Dtop style=3D'border:solid black 1.0pt;border-top:none;mso-bo=
