solid black 1.0pt;
  border-right:solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid black 1.0pt;
  mso-border-left-alt:solid black 1.0pt;padding:5.0pt 8.0pt 5.0pt 8.0pt'>
  <p class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-bottom:14.0pt;line-height:normal'><s=
pan
  style=3D'font-size:11.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Reco=
rd and
  review payments, generate financial reports<o:p></o:p></span></p>
