<h3><span style=3D'mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>5.2.2 User
acceptance testing<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<p>User acceptance testing was carried out by exercising the complete system
end to end using each of the six demonstration accounts described in the
project's README file, one for each of the five roles, covering login,
navigation, and the principal task associated with that role. Table 5.2 sum=
marises
the outcome of this testing.</p>

